\par \pard\plain \s17\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\fi0\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\hich\af4\loch\cf1\f4\loch
Smaller radii (e.g., 50\u8211\'96100 m) are possible but push higher rpm (4+), increasing discomfort for untrained/long-term residents\u8212\'97better for short stays or robots.Habitable Area and Population CapacityYou specified 10 m\u178\'b2 per inhabitant (humans + robots). This is quite dense (e.g., tight living quarters + minimal shared/ag/recreation space), but feasible with heavy automation, hydroponics, vertical farming, and robots handling most labor/maintenance. Classic designs allocate far more (~100\u8211\'96170 m\u178\'b2/person for comfort including ag/recreation). }
