\par \pard\plain \s17\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af6 \ltrch\hich\af6\loch\f6\dbch\af6 \u57352\'3f\tab}\ilvl0\ls14 \fi-283\li0\lin0\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\ri0\rin0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\hich\af4\loch\cf1\f4\loch
Gravity comfort at 100 m radius: ~3 rpm for 1G. Head-to-feet difference for a tall person (~2 m) is ~2% (acceptable/near-imperceptible). Coriolis effects are manageable for acclimated people (some studies suggest up to 4\u8211\'966 rpm tolerable; 3 rpm is in a practical range for permanent habitation with training). }
